author: pi-agent
acceptance_criteria: "An arm pattern written with or without its optional parenthesis resets the sibling scope; an escaped run key stays executable and a non-run key stays data whatever its spelling; a sequence entry's marker counts toward the indentation an indicator measures from, proven against a real YAML parser; a composite action at any path is scanned"
risk: critical
severity: critical
component: "shell-scan.ts, attestation.ts"
dependencies[1]{id,kind,created_at,author,source_kind,author_source}:
  ops-setc,related,"2026-09-02T19:24:38.684Z",pi-agent,"cli:update:dep",detected
close_reason: "All four confirmed by execution and fixed, with fourteen constructions re-verified and no regression. The escaped-key and arm-pattern guards are revert-proof against their own reverts. The opener refinement that distinguishes the case keyword from an arm pattern spelling it is pinned at unit level but had no end-to-end construction demonstrating a fail-open, and is recorded as a correctness refinement rather than a closed hole."
body: ""
